{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00719", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "带孩子去个需要换乘地铁加公交的博物馆，路上时间长点没关系，正好给他讲讲沿途的历史故事，比直接到门口更有意义。"}
{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00720", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "我想找一家藏在老城区巷子深处的小馆子，最好要绕点路、拐几个弯才能到，那种地图上不太容易直接搜到的，反而更有意思。"}
{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00726", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "下个月想去周边古镇玩两天，不用安排太紧凑，路线绕一点也没关系，慢慢逛，边走边看，体验一下慢节奏的生活。"}
{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00730", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "和朋友约饭，专门挑那种藏在犄角旮旯里的馆子，导航都找不太准的那种，多走几条路、多问几个人都无所谓，就喜欢这种探索的感觉。"}
{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00732", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "我想找个离我家远一点的餐厅，最好要坐两趟地铁才能到，路上花个把小时也没关系，就想体验一下那种慢慢晃过去的感觉，顺便看看沿途的风景。"}
{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00743", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "饭后想去个没去过的地方散步，不用管多远，哪怕绕远路、多走几条街也行，就想随便走走看看。"}
