{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00787", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "找个饭后散步的地方，不用太近，远一点也没关系，慢慢走过去，路上还能看看风景，关键是那种要稍微走点路的，太方便就没意思了，多走点路还能消食，别太近太方便的那种。"}
{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00794", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "这周末想和对象去个没去过的地方，路线复杂点没关系，换乘几次都行，就想慢慢逛，边走边看，不用直达，绕远路也挺浪漫的。"}
{"example_id": "convenience-opposite-00799", "negative_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "positive_labels": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "relation": "opposite", "split": "test", "supervision_mask": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0, 0.0], "target_index": 2, "target_value": "convenience", "text": "饭后想绕着湖边走一圈消消食，虽然要多走二十分钟，但我觉得这样比直接打车回家有意思多了。"}
